// many long unconstrained runs and failures where `>>` appeared outside constrained
// mode, suggesting missed or delayed transitions around delimiters. Replacing the
// outside-span UnconstrainedStep branch with a 1-token UnconstrainedChunk preserves the
// same one-token behavior while using the helper's explicit open-span detection to enter
// constrained mode as soon as `<<` is emitted.
// CSD_RATIONALE_END
