//   In the complete-prefix branch, CloseConstrainedSpan sets insideConstrainedOut
//   to false, making the implication vacuous. In the active constrained branch,
//   GroupBoostedConstrainedStep guarantees either EOS or a parser-valid next token;
//   on non-EOS, AppendConstrainedToken preserves parser validity.
// suffix: In the unconstrained branch, remaining outside constrained mode keeps
//   the implication vacuous; if UnconstrainedChunk stops on `<<`, generated now
//   ends with the delimiter while currentConstrainedOut is reset to [], so the
//   length-0 suffix equals []. In the complete-prefix branch, CloseConstrainedSpan
//   resets currentConstrainedOut to [], so the implication is vacuous. In the
//   active constrained branch, AppendConstrainedToken appends the same token to
//   generated and currentConstrainedOut, preserving the suffix relationship.
// cost accounting: The loop uses local steps and returns cost := steps.
//   UnconstrainedChunk bumps helper cost by stepsUsed, and this branch does
//   steps := steps + stepsUsed exactly once; when stepsUsed == 0 it must have
//   broken immediately, so no non-breaking iteration fails to advance. The
//   CloseConstrainedSpan and GroupBoostedConstrainedStep branches each bump cost
//   by 1 and the loop increments steps by 1 exactly once there as well.
// progress: In the unconstrained branch, UnconstrainedChunk appends exactly
//   stepsUsed tokens and we increment steps by stepsUsed; if it stops on EOS we
//   break immediately, and if it stops on `<<` the generated growth is still
//   bounded by stepsUsed. CloseConstrainedSpan appends at most one token and
//   increments steps by 1. GroupBoostedConstrainedStep samples one constrained
//   token; on non-EOS we append exactly one token with AppendConstrainedToken and
//   increment steps by 1, while on EOS we break after the same single-step
//   accounting. Thus every non-breaking branch strictly increases steps and
//   preserves |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps.
// CSD_PROOF_SKETCH_END
generated := generatedPrefix;
insideConstrainedOut := insideConstrained;
currentConstrainedOut := currentConstrained;
cost := 0;

var steps: nat := 0;
var narrowThreshold: nat := 12;

while steps < maxSteps
  invariant 0 <= steps <= maxSteps
  invariant lm.ValidTokensIdsLogits()
  invariant !insideConstrainedOut ==> currentConstrainedOut == []
  invariant insideConstrainedOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentConstrainedOut)
  invariant insideConstrainedOut ==> |currentConstrainedOut| <= |generated|
  invariant insideConstrainedOut ==> generated[|generated| - |currentConstrainedOut|..] == currentConstrainedOut
  invariant |generated| <= |generatedPrefix| + steps
  invariant cost == 0
  decreases maxSteps - steps
{
